 "oldMagazineNote": "oldMagazine: from \"from\" to \"release\" show a second copy of the replica's Magazine on the same bone with its own magazineOnBone (the old magazine being pulled out). At \"release\" detach it in place and let it fly: releaseVelocity (m/s) and releaseSpin (rad/s, axis times rate) are in the figure's space with Blender axes (three.js: x, z, -y), plus the figure's own movement; fall with gravity, stop on the ground lying on its side, remove after lifetime seconds. The replica's own magazine stays hidden over replicaMagazineHidden, so only one magazine is ever in view."
